# A provider's question over its card (decision 020): only over the card
# that's shown, it stops typing, and it goes with its card.

scenario: a question opens only over the card that's shown
start timer
ask timer                           -> dialog=none          # not expanded
click
ask other                           -> dialog=none          # not this card
ask timer                           -> Expanded dialog=timer
close-dialog                        -> Expanded dialog=none # answered: the card stays

scenario: not over another card
panel focus
panel notes
click                               -> expanded=focus
ask notes                           -> dialog=none

scenario: a question stops typing, and the field can't take focus under it
start timer
click
focus timer add
type hello
ask timer                           -> dialog=timer draft=none
focus timer add                     -> draft=none

scenario: the question goes with its card
start timer
start media
click
switch timer
ask timer
switch media                        -> dialog=none
switch timer
ask timer
outside                             -> dialog=none Split

scenario: a dormant panel's card can ask too
panel focus
click
card focus
ask focus                           -> dialog=focus

scenario: a toast at a card's bottom goes by itself, when acted on, or with its card (decision 071)
panel notes keep
click
card notes                          -> Expanded expanded=notes
toast notes                         -> Expanded toast=notes
wait 4999                           -> Expanded toast=notes
wait 1                              -> Expanded toast=none
toast notes                         -> Expanded toast=notes
toast-acted                         -> Expanded toast=none
toast notes                         -> Expanded toast=notes
esc                                 -> Idle toast=none
